*The release date for the Theatre of Blood was silently announced in [[Update:Bryophyta: The Moss Giant Boss|an update]] on [[3 May]] [[2018]] via a leaflet just north of the [[Ectofuntus]], which displayed the following message when read:
[[File:Theatre_of_Blood_leaflet_teaser.png|thumb|251px|The leaflet found north of the Ectofuntus.]]
{{Cquote2|Lady Verzik cordially invites you to the Theatre of Blood!<br/>The greatest collection of powerful beasts are here for your entertainment.

Tickets available from June 7th!}}
*The date was then changed to "Pentember 15th" after a player complaint of the leaflet not using the [[Calendar#Months_of_the_year|canonical in-game calendar]].
*Upon the release of the Theatre of Blood, the update went live with a placeholder loot table instead of the intended loot table. This was hotfixed prior to the first completion of the raid.{{CiteReddit|author=Mod Ash|url=https://www.reddit.com/r/2007scape/comments/1m72il8/comment/n4xpuar/|title=21 Years at Jagex + RuneFest Medley (Deluxe) music video {{!}} AMA |quote=ToB was written with a placeholder loot table before the final balancing pass was done. It was then launched with the placeholder version still in place, rather than pasting the final version over it. Fortunately someone noticed this before the first player completion, and we hotfixed it before they reached the end.|date=24 July 2025|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/27964004|archivedate=13 May 2026}}
*Upon the release of the Theatre of Blood, there was a bug which would cause players to drop the item in the top right corner of their inventory on the floor upon death, if they were in possession of [[Dawnbringer]]. This bug was hotfixed within one hour of discovery. In one instance, the player was an [[Ironman Mode|ironman]] whose [[Armadyl chestplate]] was picked up by their teammate, and as they could not trade it back, Jagex offered to swap the item to its owner.{{CiteReddit|url = https://www.reddit.com/r/2007scape/comments/8pbg19/just_lost_my_only_armadyl_chestplate_due_to_a_bug/e09yr04/|title = Just lost my only armadyl chestplate due to a bug in ToB, kept this instead|author = Mod Ayiza|name = Ayiza comment|date=7 June 2018|quote=We have so far had two confirmed instances of this occurring, and in one instance (this one), a player has lost an item due to no fault of their own. This item went to another member of the party. We have since removed that item from them and will be returning it to the player who initially lost the item, as they are an Ironman.|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/103479|archivedate=01 November 2022}}
*Its name may be a reference to the 1973 film ''{{wp|Theatre of Blood}}''.
*Its subject matter may be derived from the <i>Théâtre des Vampires</i>, from {{wp|Anne Rice}}’s series {{wp|The Vampire Chronicles}}.
*The Theatre of Blood is the only raid that:
** Lacks raid-unique supplies; the supplies offered are the same players can use, make and sell.
** Cannot be teleported out of through normal methods.
** Is non-customisable.
** Has no unique rewards that give an additional/improved effect in the raid.

